# Brigid's Command, modes 3 and 4: "Target creature you control gets +3/+3 until end of turn" and "Target creature you control fights
# target creature an opponent controls." Bot1's Grizzly Bears (2/2) is chosen for both: modes are carried out in printed order (CR 700.2d),
# so it is a 5/5 when it fights Bot2's Centaur Courser (3/3): the Courser dies and the Bears live with 3 damage (a 2/2 would have died and
# dealt only 2). The pump can't target Bot2's Courser ("you control"), the fight's second target can't be Bot1's own creature.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Grizzly Bears
Brigid's Command
Island x16

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Centaur Courser
Island x17

